From: Charlie <5764343+charlielye@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:22:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(stdlib): keep the TS contract class derivation in
 its own folder, checked against barretenberg

The artifact hash and the contract class derivation from an artifact move to
stdlib/src/contract/derivation. They stay in TS so a TS consumer can derive a class
without barretenberg's AztecContractClass. bb_parity.test.ts derives the class of
each fixture artifact both ways and requires the id, artifact hash, private
functions, private functions root and public bytecode commitment to match.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015HXzMEGRnmFYs5yXRcAWCb

